## 3. Open questions for the next pass

- Unit-conversion rules beyond hemoglobin (e.g. weight in kg vs lb) — same `metric_dictionary` pattern should cover it, but worth listing every metric you expect up front.
- Exact confidence threshold that flips `needs_review` to true.
- Invite email provider (affects `invite.service.js` only, not the schema).
- Whether `questionnaire_templates` should support more than yes/no in a later version.



